title: 'elections-phragmen: saturate the prime-vote multiplier'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    The Borda count that picks the prime member weighs each ballot position by `MaxVotesPerVoter - vote_position`. Stored ballots are a plain `Vec` and are only length-checked when `vote` is called, so a reduction of `MaxVotesPerVoter` leaves entries whose positions run past the current bound and underflow the subtraction.

    Use a saturating subtraction so those positions weigh nothing.
crates:
- name: pallet-elections-phragmen
  bump: patch
